  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1347827.svg\" alt=\"title\" width=\"169\" height=\"25\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NeoForge-lime?style=plastic&link=https://neoforged.net/\" alt=\"Static Badge\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-red?style=plastic&link=https://neoforged.net/\" alt=\"Static Badge\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此mod基於<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a>（<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-generators\" rel=\"nofollow\">Generators</a>）新增自訂的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>類別，讓新玩家能在無需查閱外部文件的情況下了解更多。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/MekaGenJei/screen/bio.png?raw=true\" width=\"752\" height=\"453\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/MekaGenJei/screen/pump.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"642\" height=\"458\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
